    "4b90bcf15334a5e616b9dc692be03c871d29cf1c56edce156b46e02157e7b97f": "Source identity and sourceUnitDigest remain the historical claim identity. Current target: docs/platform/packaging-distribution/spec.md:480-484#unheaded-block-79; SHA256 19851b062b9026d35b203683af36c1a27d3cf542f557549831e1e860138dee6a. complete unit digest equal. Full before/after content and neighboring placement are in reports/phase-09/carries/binding-refresh.json for this exact shard/key/index/claimId. Legacy/current-source parity is independently recorded in source-parity.json; a matching target digest alone does not establish source freshness. Independent review pending; no approval carry.",
